.TH INODUNE\-UNINSTALL\-HELPER 1 "2026-11-02" "inodune 0.1.11" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inodune\-uninstall\-helper \- helper used by Inodune to uninstall packages
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B inodune\-uninstall\-helper

.SH DESCRIPTION
Internal helper started by the Inodune desktop app. It simulates a
package removal, shows a plan and runs it only once, after confirmation,
through PackageKit, Flatpak, Snap or Steam. It refuses to run as root and is
not meant to be started by hand.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/caiolombello/inodune
